cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Maieusis v0.1.0, please cite this software release using its
  version-specific DOI.
type: software
title: "Maieusis"
abstract: >-
  An agent-operated scientific question-development system that transfers
  source-backed question-forming patterns and evaluates whether proposed
  question families can be responsibly planned through inspection of a real
  target dataset before scientific analysis.
